Package: MIRA
Type: Package
Title: Frozen Two-Step Classification of Renal Cell Carcinoma Expression Profiles
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Xiaofan", "Lu", email = "xlu.cpu@foxmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Applies a frozen two-step classifier based on major histocompatibility
    complex class II and B-lineage gene expression ranks. The package includes
    fixed numeric model parameters, a full expression rank background, synthetic
    examples and prediction functions. Calibration uses a complete unlabeled
    target study or assay batch. The classifier is intended for research use.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: stats, utils
URL: https://github.com/xlucpu/MIRA
BugReports: https://github.com/xlucpu/MIRA/issues
